      <version name="1.3" author="kallums" time="2026-10-16T18:00:00Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[A final pass over Apple's design guidelines: menus and tooltips are lighter than the window and easier to read; the scrollbar and the Loop tick box can be seen clearly; at bigger text sizes rows of buttons and long lines wrap instead of running off the edge, and the window can no longer be made too small to use; Esc first lets go of whatever the keyboard is on (or closes the chord editor) before closing the window; while anything plays there is a Stop in the menu bar; Start Again From and removing a chord can be undone from the message; why entries were left out is written out; and the window's title names the idea showing.]]></changelog>
